slides.content:
For GET requests, use `HttpParams` to build query strings immutably:

```typescript
let params = new HttpParams().set('page', '1').set('limit', '10');
// params = params.append('sort', 'asc');

this.http.get('/api/users', { params });
```

The resulting URL: `/api/users?page=1&limit=10`. The `fromObject` shortcut also exists: `HttpParams({ fromObject: { page: 1, limit: 10 } })`.

